                <pb facs="0244" n="142" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg142"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">723.2515/384: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-12-23T12:00:00-03:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 23,
                                1918, 12 noon.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received
                            3.57 p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Statement of President handed to Da Gama the day Embassy received it. Before
                    receipt of message Minister had taken steps along line which your December 4th,
                    7 p.m. suggested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
